{"3931990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Five Stars", "steam_appid": 3931990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re on the run. The city is on lockdown. Cops, SWAT, soldiers and armored juggernauts are hunting you down — and they won’t stop until you’re dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Five Stars</i> is a fast-paced PvE shooter set in a procedurally generated, fully destructible city.<br>There’s no end — just waves of escalating force. The more you kill, the harder they hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural <strong>infinite city</strong> — no limits to how far you can go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-loot</strong> dead enemies for weapons and armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bulletproof vests, helmets, leg/arm armor — each piece has real durability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All weapons kill in one shot — protect yourself or die fast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible environments</strong> — shoot buildings, cars, cover, anything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black market</strong> between runs — buy gear with the loot you collected</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot-based <strong>progression </strong>— better gear means you can go further and cause more damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic character damage — shoot a vest, it's gone. Shoot a limb? It's also gone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed <strong>solo</strong> in just 11 days. It’s short, intense, and focused on replayable chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 <strong>PLANNED UPDATES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI pathfinding &amp; cover system (C++ A*)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization &amp; performance pass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons (rockets, grenades, sniper)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy types (helicopters, armored units)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual polish (FX, animations, destruction debris)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment upgrades (props, cover, verticality)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins + female character support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If players enjoy this game, I’ll keep expanding it.<br>Thanks for playing <i>Five Stars</i>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re on the run. The city is on lockdown. Cops, SWAT, soldiers and armored juggernauts are hunting you down — and they won’t stop until you’re dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Five Stars</i> is a fast-paced PvE shooter set in a procedurally generated, fully destructible city.<br>There’s no end — just waves of escalating force. The more you kill, the harder they hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural <strong>infinite city</strong> — no limits to how far you can go</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-loot</strong> dead enemies for weapons and armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bulletproof vests, helmets, leg/arm armor — each piece has real durability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All weapons kill in one shot — protect yourself or die fast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible environments</strong> — shoot buildings, cars, cover, anything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black market</strong> between runs — buy gear with the loot you collected</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot-based <strong>progression </strong>— better gear means you can go further and cause more damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic character damage — shoot a vest, it's gone. Shoot a limb? It's also gone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed <strong>solo</strong> in just 11 days. It’s short, intense, and focused on replayable chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠 <strong>PLANNED UPDATES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI pathfinding &amp; cover system (C++ A*)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization &amp; performance pass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New weapons (rockets, grenades, sniper)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy types (helicopters, armored units)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual polish (FX, animations, destruction debris)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environment upgrades (props, cover, verticality)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins + female character support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If players enjoy this game, I’ll keep expanding it.<br>Thanks for playing <i>Five Stars</i>.</p>", "short_description": "You’re on the run. The city is on lockdown. They won’t stop until you’re dead. Five Stars is a fast-paced PvE shooter set in a procedurally generated, fully destructible city. There’s no end — just waves of escalating force. The more you kill, the harder they hit.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931990/c0abb604cda3c5f5a1c8cb6a250edbe0079f95d4/header.jpg?t=1757042195", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931990/1a113a6db9b97c2a81b26d347e014ecc5306cf17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757042195", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931990/1a113a6db9b97c2a81b26d347e014ecc5306cf17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757042195", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit proc